<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference</p>
<p>prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean coffee,</p>
<p>effective June 12-18:</p>
<p>	 Washed arabic....................$ 210.56</p>
<p>	 Natural arabic...................$ 204.54</p>
<p>	 Robust natural...................$  71.62</p>
<p>	 Roasted and/or ground............$ 164.31</p>
</text>
